190
00:11:12,800 --> 00:11:16,900
These 18 nozzles will stroke more than 3,000 times

191
00:11:16,901 --> 00:11:22,400
times before it's done measuring out all of the 1,200 pounds of cookie dough.

192
00:11:24,040 --> 00:11:25,300
Oh, wow.

